      <h1>About The Queen Dairy Menu</h1>
    <p><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu (thequeendairymenu.us) is an independent, community-driven foodie and price reference guide.</strong> Our goal is simple: provide the most accurate, user-friendly, and comprehensive breakdown of the Dairy Queen® menu online so you know exactly what to order, what it costs, and how it tastes before stepping up to the drive-thru or counter. We are strictly independent and not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Dairy Queen®, International Dairy Queen, Inc., or Berkshire Hathaway Inc.</p>
