    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
    <p>This site is run by a small, independent team of longtime Dairy Queen fans — not by the company. We are enthusiasts who eat at DQ, track the seasonal Blizzard rotations, and got tired of piecing together prices and calories from scattered, out-of-date sources. So we built one reference and have maintained it ever since. We are editorially independent: the company has no involvement in, and no control over, what we publish.</p>

    <h2>Why We Built This Site</h2>
    <p>Dairy Queen's menu is unusually dynamic. Blizzard flavors rotate by season, limited-time items come and go, and prices differ from one franchise to the next. There was no single, well-organized place to see the whole menu with realistic prices and calorie counts. Our goal is to fill that gap with a resource that is easy to search, honest about its limits, and kept current.</p>

    <h2>How We Research and Verify Our Information</h2>
    <p>Accuracy is the entire point of a menu reference, so we take it seriously. Our process combines several sources:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Publicly available menu information</strong> — we cross-reference official Dairy Queen menu listings and nutrition/allergen resources as our primary baseline.</li>
      <li><strong>In-store and regional menus</strong> — because franchises price independently, we compare menu boards and receipts from multiple locations to arrive at realistic figures.</li>
      <li><strong>Ongoing observation</strong> — we track seasonal launches and limited-time offers as they are announced and as they appear in stores.</li>
      <li><strong>Clear labeling of estimates</strong> — where a price is an average or an item varies by location, we say so rather than implying a single national price.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>When information conflicts or an item changes, we default to the most conservative, verifiable figure and note when something is approximate.</p>

    <h2>How Often We Update</h2>
    <p>We review and refresh content throughout the year — with particular attention to seasonal Blizzard rotations, new limited-time items, and periodic price changes. Individual pages are revised as menus shift, and we correct errors promptly when they are reported.</p>

    <h2>What We Cover</h2>
    <p>We cover the full DQ menu: Blizzard Treats and their seasonal flavors, Signature Stackburgers, Chicken Strip Baskets, Classic Treats, Breakfast (at participating locations), Drinks, DQ Cakes, Snacks &amp; Sides, Kids Meals, and current <a href="/combos">deals and combos</a>. Browse by <a href="/#full-menu">the full menu</a> or by category.</p>

    <h2>A Note on Prices and Accuracy</h2>
    <p>Please treat every price and calorie figure on this site as a <strong>2026 estimate, not an official quote</strong>. Dairy Queen locations are independently owned and operated, and they set their own prices — so your local store may differ from the averages we list. Menu availability (especially breakfast and limited-time items) also varies by location. For an exact price or to confirm an item is available, contact your <a href="/locations">local DQ</a>. Nutrition figures are provided for general reference; if you have an allergy or dietary need, rely on the official Dairy Queen allergen information.</p>

    <h2>Editorial Independence &amp; How This Site Is Funded</h2>
    <p>This site is free to use and is supported by advertising, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>. Advertising revenue keeps the site running, but it does not influence our content: we do not accept payment from Dairy Queen or any brand to alter prices, calories, or descriptions, and ads are clearly identifiable as ads. You can read more in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>.</p>

    <h2>Corrections &amp; Feedback</h2>
    <p>Spotted an out-of-date price or an error? We genuinely want to know — reader corrections are one of the best ways we keep this site accurate. Please <a href="/contact">send us the details</a> (item, location, and what you saw), and we will review and update it.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions, corrections, or suggestions are always welcome through our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>. You can also follow along on the social channels linked in the footer.</p>

    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>This site is not affiliated with Dairy Queen® or International Dairy Queen, Inc. All Dairy Queen® trademarks — including Blizzard®, Peanut Buster®, Dilly Bar®, FlameThrower®, MooLatté®, and DQ® — are the property of their respective owners and are used here for nominative reference only. See our full <a href="/disclaimer">disclaimer</a> for details.
